      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Bado kuna pigo moja nitakalomletea Farao na nchi ya Misri. Baadaye atawaacheni mwondoke hapa. Tena atakapowaacheni mwondoke, yeye mwenyewe atawafukuza mwondoke kabisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waambie Waisraeli sasa wasikie vizuri kwamba kila mmoja wao, mwanamume kwa mwanamke, ni lazima amwombe jirani yake vito vya fedha na dhahabu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akawafanya Waisraeli wapendeke mbele ya Wamisri. Tena, Mose mwenyewe akawa mtu mashuhuri sana nchini Misri, na mbele ya maofisa wa Farao na watu wote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akamwambia Farao, “Mwenyezi-Mungu asema hivi: ‘Panapo usiku wa manane leo, nitapitia katikati ya nchi ya Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitakapopita, kila mzaliwa wa kwanza nchini Misri atakufa: Kuanzia mzaliwa wa kwanza wako wewe Farao ambaye ni mrithi wako, hadi mzaliwa wa kwanza wa mjakazi anayesaga nafaka kwa jiwe. Hata wazaliwa wa kwanza wa mifugo nao wote watakufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutakuwa na kilio kikubwa kote nchini Misri, kilio ambacho hakijapata kutokea, wala hakitatokea tena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini miongoni mwa Waisraeli hakuna mtu, mnyama au mbwa wao atakayepatwa na madhara yoyote, ili upate kutambua kwamba mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu hutofautisha kati ya Waisraeli na Wamisri.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose akamalizia kwa kumwambia Farao, “Watumishi wako hawa watanijia na kuinama mbele yangu kwa heshima, wakinisihi niondoke nchini Misri, mimi pamoja na watu wote wanaonifuata. Baada ya hayo, nitaondoka.” Kisha Mose, huku akiwa ameghadhabika, akaondoka kwa Farao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Farao hatakusikiliza, ili maajabu yangu yapate kuongezeka nchini Misri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mose na Aroni walifanya maajabu hayo yote mbele ya Farao. Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu alimfanya Farao kuwa mkaidi, akakataa kuwaruhusu Waisraeli waondoke nchini mwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
